chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m019-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"潘崇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001899","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p019","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji040-008","person_id":"cbr-p001899","title":"傅","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p018","quote":"四十六年，初，成王將以商臣爲太子，語令尹子上。子上曰：「君之齒未也，而又多内寵，絀乃亂也。楚國之舉常在少者。且商臣蜂目而豺聲，忍人也，不可立也。」王不聽，立之。後又欲立子職而絀太子商臣。商臣聞而未審也，告其傅潘崇曰：「何以得其實？」崇曰：「饗王之寵姬江羋而勿敬也。」商臣從之。江羋怒曰：「宜乎王之欲殺若而立職也。」商臣告潘崇曰：「信矣。」崇曰：「能事之乎？」曰：「不能。」「能亡去乎？」曰：「不能。」「能行大事乎？」曰：「能。」冬十月，商臣以宮衞兵圍成王。成王請食熊蹯而死，不聽。丁未，成王自絞殺。商臣代立，是爲穆王。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji040-008:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p018","start":103,"end":104,"surface":"傅","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m018-0104","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"保存本段授位、任事或既有用稱；原紀年不換算，未知起訖不由首次提及、卒日、逃亡或被俘補造。追稱、制度含義與跨篇身份仍待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji040-009","person_id":"cbr-p001899","title":"太師","kind":"office","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p019","quote":"穆王立，以其太子宮予潘崇，使爲太師，掌國事。穆王三年，滅江。四年，滅六、蓼。六、蓼，皋陶之後。八年，伐陳。十二年，卒。子莊王侶立。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji040-009:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p019","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"太師","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m019-0010","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p019","quote":"穆王立，以其太子宮予潘崇，使爲太師，掌國事。穆王三年，滅江。四年，滅六、蓼。六、蓼，皋陶之後。八年，伐陳。十二年，卒。子莊王侶立。